{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028143055910-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028143751\"/><p>銀礦灣泳灘懸掛的紅旗已經除下。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（10月28日）宣布，離島區的銀礦灣泳灘懸掛的紅旗已經除下。該泳灘較早前因大浪關係而懸掛紅旗。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:01:12.822507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T06:30:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:37.047879+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T06:58:35.656282+00:00","content_hash":"24672b910a073916abab4eb0b0a2d5531a83baa36217601347437354d4df26bd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}